      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## CubeSandbox sandbox resources (Prometheus)\nFilter by **Cluster / Node / Sandbox**. Metrics come only from Cubelet `127.0.0.1:9998/v1/metrics/resource`; host and control-plane resources are not collected. **Sampled sandboxes** counts current resource samples and is not a complete business-state running count.\n> Logs: **[CubeSandbox sandbox logs](/d/cubesandbox-logs/cubesandbox-logs)**",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.4.0",
      "title": "About",
      "type": "text"
    },
